-- Pool mints for every PumpSwap pool that appears in fixtures/golden-500.jsonl.
--
-- Exported from a live run. Without this the demo container starts with an
-- empty pools table, every lookup is a cache miss, and the replay finishes
-- before any of the background RPC calls come back. The result is events with
-- no trades attached.
--
-- With it, the cache is primed before the first transaction is read and no RPC
-- call is made at all.
--
-- Decimals are NULL because the pool account stores mints but not their decimal
-- precision. Amounts are stored raw, so this only affects display.

